58\113\176\24","\196\57\93\25"),"We're for sure friends! Of course! Just us Mains! Hahaha!",v7("\232\77\163\150\70\207\12\185\150\15\203\12\182\140\92\194\13\240\163\70\217\68\240\132\93\207\12\191\137\75\207\94\240\145\71\203\66\240\145\93\207\73\163\196\15\227\12\179\141\74\201\71\181\129\14\138\120\167\140\76\207\13","\47\170\44\208\229"),v7("\97\2\182\27\13\226\119\70\71\168\31\9\167\53\77\71\176\90\15\232\119\92\74\187\90\20\228\50\73\76\255\90\50\167\63\73\84\187\90\25\226\50\70\2\170\21\91\230\119\76\75\185\90\8\238\35\77\3\254\41\18\234\62\68\67\172\90\31\242\36\92\3","\87\40\34\222\122\123\135"),v7("\103\52\146\61\129\216\64\43\132\117\195\213\68\51\193\52\211\223\84\51\133\117\199\223\83\56\151\48\211\145\1\14\137\58\214\157\78\59\135\38\128\144\118\50\143\49\196\194\71\40\141\116","\176\33\93\225\85\161"),v7("\139\31\205\246\120\177\10\132\209\57\181\24\131\192\106\226\13\130\148\113\167\24\159\148\120\160\22\152\192\57\182\17\136\148\93\167\15\130\218\112\163\23\193\148\80\226\17\140\194\124\226\24\205\192\120\174\18\204\148\73\176\28\157\213\107\167\29\204\148\95\173\11\128\213\109\182\28\137\149","\25\194\121\237\180"),"Bassie has scales, I have a shell! We're both wearing the correct outfit!","I almost said something and then didn't! That's normal! That's a normal thing I do!"},[v7("\135\135\11\6\40\126\139\152\23","\42\212\215\89\79\102")]={"Sprinting! Or— whatever that was! It was fast! I noticed the fast!","Ooo, speed! I'm not built for speed! I'm built for gently holding small bones!","Go! Go! I'll keep up! I won't keep up! But I'll keep going!","That's the fast one! I remember the fast one! I've read about velocity!","Careful on the corners! Actually— don't be careful! Be fast! Sorry!","You're so quick! I'm the slow one of the team and I've made peace with it!","Fast fast fast! That's the whole sentence! I panicked!",v7("\133\68\42\80\195\71\76\242\247\80\100\55\206\66\75\254\186\88\41\5\220\15\7\195\191\84\61\80\216\75\85\242\247\83\49\25\195\90